onfirmed_current', '+1 978-442-2200', 'CLSCustServ@corning.com', 'One Riverfront Plaza, Corning, NY 14831, USA', 'https://www.corning.com/emea/en/products/life-sciences/support-main.html', 'HQ (Corning Inc. corporate address and +1 607-974-9000 from a directory, possibly outdated); phone/email shown are Corning Life Sciences Americas customer service (toll-free +1 800-492-1110 opt. 2, fax +1 978-442-2476); EMEA customer service CSEurope@corning.com, EMEA scientific support ScientificSupportEMEA@corning.com; Americas scientific support ScientificSupport@corning.com.');
