pose the Israel entry in search snippets, so manufacturer-side confirmation is missing; Visium/Xenium were not seen on Danyel''s page. 10x Genomics'' Scale Bio distributors page lists Lifegene (Mevo Horon) for Israel; Danyel Biotech has the 10x brand page for Chromium/Visium/Xenium.', 'medium', 'Distributor''s own brand page plus a 2019 university event; no manufacturer-side listing seen.', 'company', 'verified', 2026, 'confirmed_current', '+1 925 401 7300', '', '6230 Stoneridge Mall Road, Pleasanton, CA 94588, USA', '', 'HQ. Address/phone from GlobalData, Creditsafe and IPOScoop profiles; no general email seen.');
