 Raman microscopes on its European country sites, serves Israel through a dedicated qd-europe.com/il site run from its ''Italy and Israel branch office'' in Rome. No source names an Israeli distributor for Andor cameras or NanoAnalysis EDS/EBSD, and the 21-domain Israeli distributor sweep returned only Quantum Design pages. Nothing credible found after four angles: the brand restricted to 43 Israeli distributor domains, a Hebrew importer/representative query, a search restricted to oxinst.com / andor.oxinst.com / nano.oxinst.com (Israel appears only as a country option in the Andor, Imaris and WITec contact forms; the WITec page says to contact HQ where no official representative exists), and an Israeli sole-supplier (ספק יחיד) tender query. No source seen names an Israeli distributor for Andor cameras, NanoAnalysis EDS/EBSD or WITec Raman; the Israeli channel may be direct from the UK/EU or via a company outside the domain list. Status remains none_found.', 'low', 'Four different search angles found no Israeli entity; absence of evidence only.', 'company', 'partial', 2026, 'changed', '+44 1865 393200', '', 'Tubney Woods, Abingdon, Oxfordshire OX13 5QX, UK', '', 'HQ. Address/phone per Sharecast and GlobalData profiles; fax +44 1865 393333; no general email seen.');
