n Israel'', effective immediately. Seen via the search-engine excerpt of the official page; the page itself could not be opened (host denied by egress proxy), so the previous distributor and ISI''s website were not captured. Metrohm Middle East FZC (Dubai) is the regional subsidiary for MENA; Israel is not among its listed authorised distributors. Hebrew search and ISI''s own site were not checked (search budget exhausted).', 'medium', 'Israeli distributor comes from the manufacturer''s own 2025 announcement (strong); size figures could not be sourced.', 'company', 'verified', 2025, 'confirmed_current', '+41 71 353 85 85', 'info@metrohm.com', 'Ionenstrasse, 9100 Herisau, Switzerland', 'https://www.metrohm.com/en/company/how-to-find-us.html', 'HQ (Metrohm AG). Phone/address per the official ''How to find us'' page (fax +41 71 353 89 01); email per the official Company info page.');
