rmany', 'https://www.heidolph.com/asia/ko/Contact/WorldWideExperts', 'HQ (Heidolph Scientific Products GmbH & Co. KG); Middle East/Africa/Asia distributor list PDF on heidolph.com; North America: 1235 N Mittel Blvd Suite B, Wood Dale IL 60191, +1 224-265-9600, sales@heidolph.com, https://www.heidolph-instruments.com/na/en_US/contact/Corporate-Contact');
