ds, incubators, ULT freezers) with model families such as Airstream and Labculture; the same page surfaced again in two later .co.il-wide searches. Danyel Biotech is therefore recorded as the Israeli distributor. Esco''s own distributor locator (escolifesciences.com) was not searched within the budget, so Esco''s Medical/pharma-isolator lines may have a different Israeli channel.', 'medium', 'Distributor established from its own dedicated Esco page; no manufacturer-side confirmation.', 'company', 'verified', 2026, 'confirmed_current', '+65 6542 0833', '', '19 Changi South Street 1, Singapore 486777', '', 'HQ; address from Esco careers site, phone from third-party directories (medindexer, sgpgrid) which show postal code 486779; no general email seen');
