 brand page (Ornat''s pipettes category and Tamar''s ''Pipetman-compatible tips'' page appeared, neither evidencing representation). Result: no Israeli entity identified; the manufacturer''s country selector probably lists one but could not be read through search snippets. Agentek''s own vendors page (agentek.co.il/vendors) lists the brand among the manufacturers it represents in Israel (seen in a search excerpt; the manufacturer''s own distributor page was not opened). Lifegene''s own site has Gilson brand and category pages (PIPETMAN Classic/Neo, PLATEMASTER); Agentek''s vendors list also names Gilson, so there appear to be two Israeli channels.', 'medium', 'No Israeli entity found; absence of evidence only.', 'estimate', 'verified', 2026, 'confirmed_current', '+1 608-836-1551', '', '3000 Parmenter Street, P.O. Box 620027, Middleton, WI 53562-0027, USA', 'https://gmlh.gilson.com/GMLHSV/services-and-support/contact.html', 'HQ (Gilson Incorporated, Global Headquarters). Toll-free +1 800-445-7661; fax +1 608-831-4451. Customer-service / tech-support emails exist on the contact page but were not visible in results.');
