cturer''s official distributor page.', 'estimate', 'verified', 2026, 'confirmed_current', '+41 81 286 95 30', '', 'Tardisstrasse 201, 7205 Zizers, Switzerland', 'https://www.integra-biosciences.com/global/en/contacts', 'HQ. Address from official contacts page; phone from BioTechniques / Datanyze listings (not visible on the official page in results). Customer-care and tech-support email links exist on the contacts page but were not shown. Second HQ in Hudson, NH, USA.');
