ce.', 'high', 'Israel finding only: confirmed on both the manufacturer''s and the distributor''s sites.', 'estimate', 'verified', 2026, 'confirmed_current', '+49 781 96968-0', 'germany@bmglabtech.com', 'Allmendgrün 8, 77799 Ortenberg, Germany', 'https://bmglabtech.com/de/kontakt', 'HQ. Official contact page shows address + phone, no email (contact form). Email germany@bmglabtech.com and fax +49 781 96968-67 come from a 2018 BMG contact-addresses PDF (med-fom-avgaylab.sites.olt.ubc.ca) - verify. US office: usa@bmglabtech.com (Cary, NC).');
