epligen.com; none named an Israeli distributor or office. Repligen''s distributors page repeats that products are marketed through a direct commercial organisation in the US, Europe and Asia plus strategic partners and distributors in select markets, and its locations page lists only US sites and Bengaluru. Result unchanged from round 2: no Israeli entity identified; Israel is most likely served directly from Repligen Europe or by an unnamed partner.', 'low', 'Absence of evidence only.', 'company', 'partial', NULL, 'not_found', '+1 781-250-0111', '', '41 Seyon Street, Building 1, Suite 100, Waltham, MA 02453, USA', '', 'HQ. From official investor site; toll-free +1 800-622-2259, fax +1 781-250-0115. Only role email seen is investor relations investors@repligen.com (no general/sales email).');
