trial/technical-equipment agent rather than a lab-supply house.', 'high', 'Israeli partner named on the manufacturer''s official locations page; only the partner''s website could not be located.', 'company', 'verified', 2026, 'confirmed_current', '+49 7305 10-0', 'info@zwickroell.com', 'August-Nagel-Str. 11, 89079 Ulm, Germany', '', 'HQ. From official imprint; fax +49 7305 10-11200; service hotline +49 7305 10-11225.');
